  "label": "Islamophobia",
  "description": "A fear, prejudice, or discrimination against Muslims, often manifesting as the belief that Muslims are inherently violent or terrorist-prone. This stereotype is frequently used to justify restrictive immigration policies or security measures. The meme implicitly relies on this stereotype by associating the Paris attack with ISIS (an Islamist militant group) and suggesting that a border wall would prevent such attacks, thereby implying that Muslims are a threat to Western societies.",
